{"hymn":"S816","parent":"E1319","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Lo que ningún profeta vio","subtitle":"Esperanza de gloria—La consumación de los siglos","syl":{"n1":"Lo","n2":"que","n3":["nin","i"],"n4":["gún","t"],"n6":["pro","i"],"n8":["fe","m"],"n9":["ta","t"],"n10":"vio","n11":"O","n12":["en","i"],"n13":["con","m"],"n15":["tró","t"],"n16":["ja","i"],"n18":["más;","t"],"n19":"En","n20":["nues","i"],"n21":["tros","t"],"n22":["dí","i"],"n24":["as","t"],"n26":"ya","n27":["lle","i"],"n28":["gó","t"],"n29":"En","n30":"su","n31":["re","i"],"n32":["a","m"],"n34":["li","m"],"n36":["dad.","t"],"n37":"Y","n38":["a","i"],"n39":["ho","m"],"n40":["ra‿es","t"],"n41":"el","n42":["cum","i"],"n43":["pli","m"],"n44":["mien","m"],"n45":["to,","t"],"n46":"Y","n47":"el","n48":["fi","i"],"n49":["nal","t"],"n50":"de","n51":["to","i"],"n52":["dos","t"],"n53":"los","n54":["tiem","i"],"n55":["pos.","t"],"n56":"Y","n57":["to","i"],"n58":["dos","t"],"n59":"los","n60":"que","n61":["cre","i"],"n62":["ye","m"],"n63":["ron,","t"],"n64":"Su","n65":["pro","i"],"n66":["me","m"],"n67":["sa‿he","m"],"n68":["re","m"],"n69":["da","m"],"n70":["rán.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Benditos nuestros ojos son","De ver con claridad","Lo que los ángeles jamás","Pudieron contemplar."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Estamos en el Cuerpo hoy,","Su gracia a mano está;","Hay que animarse a correr","Y el reinó así ganar."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["No nos cansamos al correr,","Nos trae enorme paz;","Pues pronto el Señor vendrá,","Mostrándonos Su faz."]}]}